From: ITSMEFRTRUST <215584995+ITSMEFRTRUST@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:58:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 019/138] spi: dt-bindings: apple,spi: Add the A7-A11 variant

Apple's A7-A11 SoCs have an older version of the SPI block (ADT
"spi-1,samsung"). It shares the low registers with the M1 one but has
no FIFOSTAT/IE/IF registers, so it is not compatible with apple,spi.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
index 9356b9c33..860bac15c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ maintainers:
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
+      - description: Older (A7-A11) variant of the block
+        const: apple,t7000-spi
       - items:
           - const: apple,t6020-spi
           - const: apple,t8103-spi
